    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so exhausting though. like, why bother trying to find a \"new foundation\" when the concept of a foundation itself is a lie? it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, useless shell around. if everything is truly just noise and emptiness, then there's no real difference between existing and not existing. it feels like there's no point in holding on to something that was never real to begin with.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
