      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how desperate the weight of \"honest\" hope can feel when the world no longer holds logic for you. It is a profound courage to acknowledge that the struggle itself is exhausting even when the struggle feels pointless, because that admission alone takes a massive emotional risk. Please remember that while the \"structure\" of the universe may feel empty to you, the you who is feeling this depth of pain is still a real, vital self that can find safety even without a \"foundation.\"",
